{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月23日，蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo今天發售，國行定價15999元起。今年iPhone Duo採用了和iPhone18 Pro Max同樣的「線上預購、線下取貨」機制，蘋果Apple Store店員表示，門店沒有提供可直接購買的現貨，未持有訂單的用户只能在10點後前往店裏體驗展示機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583518.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.855373+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:31:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"a8886eaa3b749fcb10d84767e0600c6dd5f6459a09503eab63daf6a476bb0364","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}